# Pretrained weights. They belong in the Hugging Face cache and never in the
# tree, but HF_HOME pointed at the working directory would drop hundreds of
# megabytes of them here (see lazy.CHECKPOINTS). No source file has these
# extensions, so this cannot hide one.
*.ckpt
*.safetensors
